Here is a list of the bugs fixed and the improvements with [b]patch 2.3[/b]:
[list]
[*] Added explanatory phrases in the loading with the ability to read them all. These are important tips to better enjoy the game;
[*] Added a lot of sounds to the game interface;
[*] Changed the text within the book modules;
[*] Fixed mouse click behavior in tasting when no potion was selected;
[*] Fixed some bugs that lead to incorrect display of names in the wrong language;
[*] Activated the multiple potions perk to produce multiple potions simultaneously. You can unlock it as usual in the Knowledge activity. This perk is very strong because you can produce multiple potions using just the time of one, the important thing is that you have multiple ingredients ready to use;
[*] Enhanced the behavior of multiple buttons inside the game;
[*] Enhanced the click of the mouse on the modules of ingredients and potions;
[*] Now in the purchase activity the ingredients are colored in green or red depending on the ingredients handled by the supplier;
[*]  We have graphically reversed the percentage experience with the probability of success of the saboteurs. It is now clear what the success rates are;
[*] Improvement of the milestone panel;
[*] Fixes and general improvements to the milestones, especially when completed;
[*] Fixed graphic bug in the tools after the installment purchase of the tools;
[*] Many minor fixes.
[/list]

We are still working on all the other feedbacks and bugs.
If you have any consideration or you find a bug, please post it here or in the Steam discussions and we will do our best to solve them. Thank you!

Here is a list of the bugs fixed and the improvements with [b]patch 2.2[/b]:
[list]
[*] Now in the book of formulas you can use the search bar to better find your formulas; 
[*] Activities and helpers can now be dragged from day to day on the board. Before, you had to delete them and reinsert them from the top panel;
[*] Fixed a few bugs when using multiple helpers. These bugs mostly happened using presets when multiple helpers were present;
[*] Enhanced the mechanism of hiring a firing the helpers;
[*] Fixed a few minor bugs.
[/list]

We are still working on all the other feedbacks and bugs.
If you have any consideration or you find a bug, please post it here or in the Steam discussions and we will do our best to solve them. Thank you!

Here is a list of the bugs fixed and the improvements with [b]patch 2.1[/b]:
[list]
[*] [u]Added [/u]the "Balance Panel" it shows a detailed overview of gain and costs. It can be reached by clicking the "coins icon" in the bottom right corner;
[*] [u]Added [/u]the possibility to buy instruments in installments. They can be repaid in 10-week installments;
[*] Fixed the graphical aspect of the antidots in the tasting activity;
[*] Fixed in general the behavior of some events;
[*] Fixed an issue on the Tournament event, which showed unclear bonuses. Other minor fixes in Tournaments;
[*] Other minor fixes.
[/list]

We are still working on all the other feedbacks and bugs.
If you have any consideration or you find a bug, please post it here or in the Steam discussions and we will do our best to solve them. Thank you!

We are happy to announce the release of[b] Patch 2.0. [/b], a lot has changed since the game was released after just over a month.
We have constantly worked during this time to improve the game according to your feedback and we are now convinced that the game experience has improved substantially since the release.
This does not mean that we will stop updating the game, it simply means that the game is now ready to be transformed into a [b]Demo[/b], so new players will be able to experience the game before buying it and we will be able to add more features.

[b]Sabotages are now active[/b] also on older saves. After a few weeks of playing you will be able to perform sabotages and espionage missions to try to obtain various advantages. But not abuse them, there is a chance that you end up in jail!

Other things included in this patch:
[list]
[*] Added the poison icon to the labels that are considered poison. Now you can experience in the correct way the missions and the partners that focus on poisons;
[*] Fixed the movement of the clients inside the shop;
[*] Updated the graphical aspect of the ring, in particular the yellow part, while entering the tutorial;
[*] Fixed some minor graphical bugs while entering the tutorial;
[*] Updated the music in the "End Game" screen;
[*] Updated some mouse-over texts, and added new ones;
[*] As previously explained, Sabotages are now active;
[*] Many minor bug fixes.
[/list]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/38701144/6c5e6ff39153cb85fe15a4abfc7ef802ffc028f9.png[/img]

